description:
Animal story for children aged around 8-12 years of age.
* Take one puppy born without the ability to bark;
* Add one veterinarian who believes that dogs could talk, given the right surgery;
* Throw in a scientist who specialises in growing tissue.
What you get is a dog with a unique ability and an attitude problem.
That results in a confused family, offended neighbours, and some very scared cats!

To "Na me thumasai" einai mia sunarpastike alethine istoria pou diegeitai ton ekplektiko thriambo mias gunaikas ston polemo gia epibiose enantia stis antixoes sunthekes tes zoes se mia makrine ge.
To 1786 e Maire, e kore enos psara apo ten Kornouale, katadikazetai se thanato di' apagkhonismou gia mia mikroklope. E poine tes telika metriazetai kai tha stalei sten Australia gia na ektisei ten isobia poine tes. Mesa apo skleres dokimasies sto aphiloxeno periballon tes xenes khoras, e Maire tha katapherei okhi mono na epibiosei kai na drapeteusei, alla kai na brei ten alethine agape - mekhri na aikhmalotistei kai pali kai na odegethei alusodemene piso ste Bretania. Ste dike ekhei ten tukhe na ten uperaspizetai o diasemos dikegoros Tzeims Mposgouel, pou prospathei me kathe tropo na peisei tous dikastes gia ten athooteta tes. Tha aphethei e neare Maire eleuthere na apolausei ten agape, ten eleutheria kai, telika, ten idia te zoe;
Mia sugkinetike istoria gia ten apognose, to tharros kai te duname mias gunaikas na diekdikesei auto pou e sunteretike koinonia tes sterese: mia eleuthere zoe.

Belinda Lawrence returns to her home town of Melbourne, to discover a murder that's close to her heart.
A murder which leads to the seat of political power, Parliament House.
The various threads of deceit and intrigue are gradually unravelled and, with Hazel Whitby at her side, Belinda is confronted by warring political factions.
The mystery deepens with the discovery of a priceless historical item, of value to both political powers, and which places Belinda's life in jeopardy.
The gregarious Major;
An enigmatic university Professor;
Two colourful antique sellers;
Eccentric retired music-hall entertainers;
And Belinda's partner, Mark Sallinger...
...all immersed in the scheming and covert encounters besieging Belinda as she solves her most challenging mystery.
Book Five in the Belinda Lawrence mystery series.

* Avtor - vidomii populiarizator nauki ta bloger
* Podannia materialu - legke, strukturovane, tsikave
* V knizhtsi navedena ne til'ki korisna informatsiia, ale i nezvichaini fakti dlia tikh, khto tsikavit'sia psikhologiieiu
Korotko pro naigolovnishe, zrozumilo pro nadskladne, zakhoplivo pro profesiine!
Kniga-bestseler amerikans'kogo zhurnalista, blogera ta pis'mennika Pola Kleinmana podaruie neimovirne zadovolennia i poznaiomit' u naukovo-populiarnii formi z osnovami psikhologichnikh kontseptsii ta eksperimentiv i z malovidomimi faktami z zhittia vidatnikh uchenikh-psikhologiv. Doluchit'sia do taiemnits' pam'iati ta nesvidomogo, intelektu ta emotsii, diznaitesia pro tipi ta prichini psikhologichnikh rozladiv ta suchasni metodi yikhn'ogo likuvannia i pro te, shcho zh take kognitivnii disonans, geshtal'tpsikhologiia ta teoriia osobistisnikh ris.
A takozh:
vimiriaite riven' kokhannia za shkaloiu Zika Rubina;
namaliuite psikhologichnii portret Adol'fa Gitlera;
diznaitesia pro terapevtichnu korist' gipnozu ta art-terapiyi;
poznaiomtesia z teoriieiu shesti rukostiskan';
vidkriite taiemnitsi snovidin', intelektu ta organizatsiyi pam'iati.
Tse vidannia - spravzhnii putivnik u sviti klasichnoyi ta suchasnoyi psikhologiyi dlia tikh, khto vpershe zatsikavivsia tsiieiu naukoiu abo pragne krashche zrozumiti sebe ta povedinku liudei. Znaidit' vidpovidi na naivazhlivishi pitannia pro zakoni liuds'koyi povedinki, nalagod'te mizhosobovi stosunki, garmonizuite simeinii ta profesiino-emotsiinii fon.

Terdiri atas 2 bagian yaitu:
I. Gelak Sedih, terdiri atas 9 cerpen:
1. Gelak Sedih;
2. Hujan;
3. Bercinta dengan Barbie;
4. Dongeng Terindah untuk Alamanda;
5. Perempuan yang Bercinta dengan Iblis;
6. Lelaki Sakit;
7. Kasih Tak Sampai;
8. Assurancetourix;
9. Bibi.
II. Corat-coret di Toilet, terdiri atas 9 cerpen yang pernah dimuat pada kumpulan cerpen "Corat-coret di Toilet" (tahun 2000):
1. Peter Pan;
2. Dongeng Sebelum Bercinta;
3. Corat-coret di Toilet;
4. Teman Kencan;
5. Rayuan Dusta untuk Marietje;
6. Hikayat Si Orang Gila;
7. Si Cantik yang Tak Boleh Keluar Malam;
8. Siapa Kirim Aku Bunga;
9. Kisah.
-------------------------------------------------
Cerpen-cerpennya ditulis padat gizi dengan penokohan dan setting cerita yang kompleks. Pembaca disodorkan sinisme dan lelucon, melankoli dan fantasi, sejarah dan dongeng, yang nyata dan yang ngibul, dikocok sedemikian rupa menjadi kisah-kisah yang menyegarkan dan kadang penuh kejutan.
Setiap cerita di dalam kumpulan ini akan menjadi tidak menarik jika diringkas menjadi sebuah sinopsis untuk kepentingan publikasi di sini. Jadi, disarankan Anda untuk membelinya dan membuktikan sendiri kebenaran paragraf di atas.
